Package: unsaved
Title: Unsaved Change Tracking for 'shiny' Forms
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tanmay", "Chanda", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    email = "tanmaychanda96@gmail.com")
Description: Helps users of 'shiny' forms see which edits they have not saved,
    and asks before they leave or take an action that would lose them. Compares
    the inputs an application lists with the values it last saved, marks
    changed fields, counts and summarises the changes, and guards tab
    changes, chosen buttons and links, and closing the browser. Applications
    remain responsible for validating and saving their data.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-GB
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: shiny (>= 1.7.0), htmltools, R6
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), shinytest2, bslib, withr, rewind, chromote,
    promises
URL: https://github.com/tenmeh/unsaved, https://tenmeh.github.io/unsaved/
BugReports: https://github.com/tenmeh/unsaved/issues
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/markdown: true
